<title>USA: International Family to issue statement.</title>
<headline>International Family to issue statement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Family Entertainment Inc said it will issue a statement in about 30 minutes but declined to comment on the contents.</p>
<p>The company's shares were halted on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Chairman Pat Robinson recently said a deal involving the possible sale of the company could be struck soon. Reported interested buyers include News Corp Ltd and Walt Disney Co.</p>
<p>A News Corp spokesman declined to comment.</p>
</text>
